<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Ryder System cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Ryder System cut.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Merrill Lynch said on Thursday it had cut its rating on Ryder System Inc to near-term accumulate from buy.</p>
<p>-- Merrill kept Ryder's long-term buy rating.</p>
<p>-- Ryder closed at 29-3/4.</p>
<p>-- Wall Street Desk (212) 859-1730</p>
</text>
